# Verification

Do not mark collaboration or permissions complete from one browser.

Must observe: sign-in and reload persistence; two sessions converging; reconnect resync; presence avatars/cursors; view/comment/edit on HTTP and WebSocket; comments and snapshots; Redis multi-instance or a documented tested limitation.

Record what ran and any numbers. If a test was skipped, say so. Label mocks. No unmeasured scale claims.
